# {{product.name}} — getting started as a new developer

Welcome. This page gets you from an empty laptop to {{product.name}} running locally, in the order that
works. It is written so that **you never have to do anything administrative** — every step that needs a
permission, an account or a decision is already done by {{owner.name}} before you start, and if one is not,
the fix is to tell them, not to work around it.

**Rule zero: if a step fails and this page does not say what to do, stop and message {{owner.name}}.**
Do not create accounts, request roles or copy credentials from anywhere else to keep moving. A stalled
setup costs an hour; a workaround costs much more.

---

