## 4. Clone the repositories, side by side

Pick a folder. The code repos **should be siblings of the hub**, because `hub.json` names each one by a
path relative to the hub ({{#repos}}{{#first}}`{{path}}`{{/first}}{{/repos}} and so on).

```
git clone https://github.com/{{hub.github}}.git
{{#repos}}git clone https://github.com/{{github}}.git
{{/repos}}```

